.EE
.SS port
The first parameter is the serial port to use (\f[I]/dev/ttyS0\f[R],
\f[I]/dev/ttyS1\f[R], \f[I]/dev/ttyUSB0\f[R], \f[I]/dev/ttyUSB1\f[R] and
so on).
This parameter is mandatory.
.SS nBaud
